function Auth({mode,setMode}){const [email,E]=useState(''),[password,P]=useState(''),[business,B]=useState(''),[kind,K]=useState('Duka la rejareja'),[busy,S]=useState(false),[err,R]=useState('');async function submit(e){e.preventDefault();S(true);R('');try{if(mode==='signup'){const {data,error}=await supabase.auth.signUp({email,password,options:{data:{business_name:business,business_type:kind}}});if(error)throw error;if(data.session) await supabase.from('profiles').upsert({id:data.user.id,business_name:business,business_type:kind});else R('Angalia barua pepe yako kuthibitisha akaunti, kisha ingia.');}else{const {error}=await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({email,password});if(error)throw error;}}catch(e){R(e.message)}finally{S(false)}}return <div className="auth-wrap"><div className="auth-card"><div className="brand centered"><div className="brand-icon"><Store/></div><b>BiasharaPro</b></div><span className="eyebrow center">BIASHARA YAKO, MIKONONI MWAKO</span><h1>{mode==='signup'?'Fungua akaunti ya biashara':'Karibu tena'}</h1><p>{mode==='signup'?'Jisajili bure na anza kusimamia biashara yako.':'Ingia kuendelea na biashara yako.'}</p><form onSubmit={submit}>{mode==='signup'&&<><label>Jina la biashara</label><input required value={business} onChange={e=>B(e.target.value)} placeholder="Mfano: Tunzo Mini Mart"/><label>Aina ya biashara</label><select value={kind} onChange={e=>K(e.target.value)}>{['Duka la rejareja','Supermarket','Hardware','Boutique','Wholesaler','Pharmacy','Mgahawa','Nyingine'].map(x=><option>{x}</option>)}</select></>}<label>Barua pepe</label><input type="email" required value={email} onChange={e=>E(e.target.value)} placeholder="jina@example.com"/><label>Nenosiri (angalau herufi 6)</label><input type="password" minLength="6" required value={password} onChange={e=>P(e.target.value)} placeholder="••••••••"/>{err&&<div className="alert">{err}</div>}<button className="primary full" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Subiri…':mode==='signup'?'Jisajili':'Ingia'}</button></form><div className="switch-auth">{mode==='signup'?'Tayari una akaunti?':'Huna akaunti?'} <button onClick={()=>{setMode(mode==='signup'?'login':'signup')}}>{mode==='signup'?'Ingia':'Jisajili'}</button></div><div className="auth-foot"><ShieldCheck size={15}/> Akaunti na taarifa za kila biashara zinalindwa tofauti.</div></div></div>}
function Stat({label,value,sub,Icon,tone}){return <div className="stat"><div className={`stat-icon ${tone}`}><Icon size={19}/></div><div><small>{label}</small><strong>{value}</strong><span>{sub}</span></div></div>}
function Dashboard({sales,purchases,products,tx,chart,setPage}){const profit=sales-purchases;return <div className="content"><div className="welcome"><div><h2>Habari ya biashara yako 👋</h2><p>Huu hapa muhtasari wa shughuli zako.</p></div><button className="primary" onClick={()=>setPage('transactions')}><Plus size={17}/> Rekodi muamala</button></div><div className="stats"><Stat label="Jumla ya mauzo" value={money(sales)} sub="Mauzo yote yaliyorekodiwa" Icon={ArrowUpFromLine} tone="green"/><Stat label="Jumla ya manunuzi" value={money(purchases)} sub="Gharama za manunuzi" Icon={ArrowDownToLine} tone="orange"/><Stat label="Tofauti ya mauzo na manunuzi" value={money(profit)} sub="Si faida halisi ya uhasibu" Icon={Wallet} tone="blue"/><Stat label="Bidhaa kwenye stock" value={products.length} sub="Aina za bidhaa" Icon={Package} tone="purple"/></div><div className="panel chart-panel"><div className="panel-head"><div><h3>Mwenendo wa biashara</h3><p>Mauzo na manunuzi ya siku 7 zilizopita</p></div><span className="tag">SIKU 7</span></div><div className="chart"><ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="100%"><AreaChart data={chart}><defs><linearGradient id="sales" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stopColor="#18a879" stopOpacity={.22}/><stop offset="100%" stopColor="#18a879" stopOpacity={0}/></linearGradient></defs><CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" vertical={false} stroke="#edf1f5"/><XAxis dataKey="day" axisLine={false} tickLine={false}/><YAxis axisLine={false} tickLine={false} tickFormatter={v=>v>=1000000?(v/1000000)+'M':v>=1000?(v/1000)+'k':v}/><Tooltip formatter={v=>money(v)}/><Area type="monotone" dataKey="Mauzo" stroke="#18a879" fill="url(#sales)" strokeWidth={2.5}/><Area type="monotone" dataKey="Manunuzi" stroke="#e5a34b" fill="transparent" strokeWidth={2.2}/></AreaChart></ResponsiveContainer></div><div className="legend"><span><i className="lg-green"/> Mauzo</span><span><i className="lg-orange"/> Manunuzi</span></div></div><div className="panel recent"><di